#: ../developer/contributing.md:151
msgid ""
"`make all` does **not** type-check. `mypy` is in the `dev` dependency "
"group and you may run it by hand, but `pyproject.toml` has no "
"`[tool.mypy]` section and no target invokes it, so nothing enforces it."
msgstr ""
"`make all` **不**做类型检查。`mypy` 在 `dev` 依赖组里，可以手动运行，但 `pyproject.toml` 里没有 "
"`[tool.mypy]` 配置段，也没有哪个 target 会调用它，所以类型检查不是强制的。"

#: ../developer/contributing.md:155
msgid "Style is enforced by tooling, not by review:"
msgstr "代码风格由工具强制，而不是靠评审："

#: ../developer/contributing.md:157
msgid ""
"**ruff**, line length 100, target `py311`, with "
"`E`/`W`/`F`/`I`/`UP`/`B`/`C4`/ `SIM`/`TCH`/`RUF` enabled (`[tool.ruff]` "
"in `pyproject.toml`)."
msgstr ""
"**ruff**，行长 100，target 为 `py311`，启用 "
"`E`/`W`/`F`/`I`/`UP`/`B`/`C4`/`SIM`/`TCH`/`RUF`（见 `pyproject.toml` 的 "
"`[tool.ruff]`）。"

#: ../developer/contributing.md:159
msgid ""
"**pydocstyle**, Google convention. It skips `tests`, `.venv`, "
"`node_modules`, `apps/frontend`, `ops` and `docs`, so docstrings are "
"required in `apps/backend` and enforced there."
msgstr ""
"**pydocstyle**，采用 Google 风格。它会跳过 "
"`tests`、`.venv`、`node_modules`、`apps/frontend`、`ops` 和 `docs`，所以 "
"`apps/backend` 里必须写 docstring，并且会强制检查。"

#: ../developer/contributing.md:163
msgid "Pre-commit hooks run on commit and are installed by `make setup-dev`:"
msgstr "pre-commit 钩子在 commit 时运行，由 `make setup-dev` 安装："

#: ../developer/contributing.md:169
msgid ""
"They cover ruff (pinned to the version CI uses), pydocstyle, `gitleaks` "
"secret scanning, the standard whitespace/YAML/JSON/TOML checks, and "
"eslint + prettier for `apps/frontend`."
msgstr ""
"这些钩子包括 ruff（版本与 CI 保持一致）、pydocstyle、`gitleaks` "
"密钥扫描、常规的空白字符/YAML/JSON/TOML 检查，以及 `apps/frontend` 的 eslint + prettier。"

#: ../developer/contributing.md:173
msgid ""
"Before opening a pull request, run `make format` and make sure `make "
"test` passes."
msgstr "开 PR 之前，先跑 `make format`，并确认 `make test` 通过。"

#: ../developer/contributing.md:176
msgid "Tests"
msgstr "测试"

#: ../developer/contributing.md:178
msgid ""
"Markers are the contract; directories are a convention. The markers "
"declared in `pyproject.toml` are `unit`, `integration`, `slow`, `perf`, "
"`external` and `dbtest`, and `--strict-markers` means an undeclared "
"marker is an error."
msgstr ""
"测试分层以 marker 为准，目录只是惯例。`pyproject.toml` 里声明的 marker 有 "
"`unit`、`integration`、`slow`、`perf`、`external` 和 `dbtest`；由于开启了 `--strict-"
"markers`，使用未声明的 marker 会直接报错。"

