#: ../developer/contributing.md:190
msgid ""
"`testpaths` is `[\"tests\", \"distributions\"]`, so overlay-owned tests "
"run in the default suite alongside `tests/`."
msgstr ""
"`testpaths` 是 `[\"tests\", \"distributions\"]`，因此 overlay 自带的测试会和 "
"`tests/` 一起在默认测试集中运行。"

#: ../developer/contributing.md:205
msgid ""
"The `dbtest` tier needs a reachable PostgreSQL. Every test finds it "
"through `tests/fixtures/postgres.py`, which reads `TEST_DB_HOST`, "
"`TEST_DB_PORT`, `TEST_DB_USER`, `TEST_DB_PASSWORD` and `TEST_DB_NAME` "
"(defaulting to `localhost:5432`, `postgres`/`postgres` and "
"`hybridinference_test_db`). Starting just the database container is "
"enough:"
msgstr ""
"`dbtest` 这一层需要能连上的 PostgreSQL。所有测试都通过 "
"`tests/fixtures/postgres.py` 找到它，这个模块读取 `TEST_DB_HOST`、"
"`TEST_DB_PORT`、`TEST_DB_USER`、`TEST_DB_PASSWORD` 和 `TEST_DB_NAME`"
"（默认是 `localhost:5432`、`postgres`/`postgres` 和 "
"`hybridinference_test_db`）。只启动数据库容器就够了："

#: ../developer/contributing.md:215
msgid ""
"`make test-db` prepares the schema first and sets `TEST_DB_REQUIRED=1`, "
"so a database test that cannot connect fails instead of skipping, and "
"`TEST_DB_HOST` and `TEST_DB_PORT` must be set explicitly. CI sets the "
"same variable. No setup step is needed otherwise: each test process "
"creates and migrates its own database on first use. `uv run python -m "
"tests.fixtures.postgres prepare --workers N` does the same up front, which"
" is faster before a run with `-n N`."
msgstr ""
"`make test-db` 会先准备表结构，并设置 `TEST_DB_REQUIRED=1`：连不上数据库的"
"测试会失败而不是跳过，而且必须显式设置 `TEST_DB_HOST` 和 `TEST_DB_PORT`。"
"CI 也设置了这个变量。除此之外不需要任何准备步骤：每个测试进程会在第一次使用时"
"自己创建并迁移它的数据库。`uv run python -m tests.fixtures.postgres prepare "
"--workers N` 会预先完成同样的工作，在用 `-n N` 运行之前执行会更快。"

#: ../developer/contributing.md:222
msgid ""
"With Docker, `make test-db-local` needs no setup at all. It starts one "
"PostgreSQL container for the whole machine (`hybridinference-test-"
"postgres` on `127.0.0.1:54329`, data in memory), gives each checkout its "
"own database named from its path, prepares it, and runs the tier with one"
" worker per CPU, up to eight. The container and the databases are kept "
"between runs, so a re-run only re-reads the schema; the whole tier takes "
"about 15 seconds."
msgstr ""
"有 Docker 的话，`make test-db-local` 不需要任何准备。它在整台机器上只启动一个 "
"PostgreSQL 容器（`hybridinference-test-postgres`，监听 `127.0.0.1:54329`，"
"数据放在内存里），按路径给每个 checkout 一个自己的数据库，准备好表结构，再按每个 "
"CPU 一个 worker、最多八个的并行度运行这一层测试。容器和数据库在两次运行之间都会保留，"
"所以再次运行只需重新读取表结构；整层测试大约 15 秒。"

#: ../developer/contributing.md:221
msgid ""
"`make test` parallelises with `pytest-xdist` at file granularity. Run "
"serially when you are debugging a specific failure, but check a suspected"
" env-leak failure under `-n auto` too — cross-file environment leakage "
"only shows up under the parallel run."
msgstr ""
"`make test` 用 `pytest-xdist` 以文件为粒度并行。调查某个具体失败时可以串行跑，但怀疑是环境变量泄漏引起的失败，还要在 "
"`-n auto` 下再查一遍——跨文件的环境泄漏只有在并行运行时才会暴露。"

#: ../developer/contributing.md:226
msgid "Frontend"
msgstr "前端"

#: ../developer/contributing.md:228
msgid "The console's gates are separate from the Python ones:"
msgstr "控制台的门禁与 Python 那套是分开的："

#: ../developer/contributing.md:240
msgid ""
"CI additionally runs `npm run format:check` (prettier) and `npm audit "
"--omit=dev --audit-level=high` in `apps/frontend`."
msgstr ""
"CI 还会在 `apps/frontend` 里额外运行 `npm run format:check`（prettier）和 `npm audit"
" --omit=dev --audit-level=high`。"

#: ../developer/contributing.md:243
msgid "Documentation"
msgstr "文档"

#: ../developer/contributing.md:245
msgid ""
"These pages are MyST Markdown compiled by Sphinx from `docs/developer/`, "
"with `docs/developer/index.rst` as the root toctree. Build them, and run "
"the checks CI runs, from the repository root:"
msgstr ""
"这些页面用 MyST Markdown 编写，由 Sphinx 从 `docs/developer/` 编译，根 toctree 是 "
"`docs/developer/index.rst`。在仓库根目录下构建文档，并运行 CI 会跑的检查："

#: ../developer/contributing.md:253
msgid ""
"That builds the English and Chinese sites with warnings treated as "
"errors, checks the local links in every Markdown file, and checks that no"
" translated paragraph has quietly fallen back to English. A broken cross-"
"reference or a page missing from the toctree fails it, so run it before "
"pushing. Sphinx, `myst-parser` and `sphinx-rtd-theme` come from the `dev`"
" dependency group, so `make setup-dev` is enough to build. `make docs` "
"builds the site alone."
msgstr ""
"它会把警告当作错误来构建英文和中文站点，检查每个 Markdown "
"文件里的本地链接，并检查有没有哪段译文悄悄回退成了英文。交叉引用断了、或者某个页面没加进 "
"toctree，它都会失败，所以推送之前先跑一遍。Sphinx、`myst-parser` 和 `sphinx-rtd-theme` 都来自 "
"`dev` 依赖组，所以执行过 `make setup-dev` 就能构建。`make docs` 只构建站点。"

#: ../developer/contributing.md:260
msgid ""
"Add a new page to `docs/developer/index.rst` as well as writing it; an "
"orphan file is a warning, and warnings are errors in CI."
msgstr "新写一个页面，还要把它加进 `docs/developer/index.rst`；没加进去的孤立文件会产生警告，而 CI 会把警告当作错误。"

#: ../developer/contributing.md:263
msgid "Writing a page"
msgstr "撰写页面"

#: ../developer/contributing.md:265
msgid ""
"These pages ship with the source, and most readers arrive from a search "
"or the sidebar with one task in mind. Write for that reader:"
msgstr "这些页面随源码一起发布，大多数读者是从搜索结果或侧边栏进来的，心里只想着一件要办的事。写的时候要想着这样的读者："

#: ../developer/contributing.md:268
msgid ""
"**Say who the page is for and what they can do after reading it**, in the"
" first paragraph."
msgstr "**说明页面写给谁、读完之后能做什么**，放在第一段。"

#: ../developer/contributing.md:270
msgid ""
"**Lead with the action or the answer.** Put exceptions and edge cases "
"after it, in a note if they run long, and do not open a section with what"
" the software lacks."
msgstr "**先给出操作步骤或答案**。例外和边界情况放在后面，篇幅长的话放进 note；小节开头也不要先讲软件缺少什么。"

#: ../developer/contributing.md:273
msgid ""
"**Name a file only when the reader will open or edit it.** Do not cite "
"functions or line numbers to prove a statement; tests and review do that."
msgstr "**只有读者会打开或编辑某个文件时，才写出它的文件名**。不要为了证明某个说法去引用函数或行号；那是测试和评审的事。"

#: ../developer/contributing.md:275
msgid ""
"**Describe the software as it is now.** What changed, how it used to work"
" and how you checked belong in the pull request or the release notes."
msgstr "**描述软件现在的样子**。改了什么、以前是怎么工作的、你是怎么验证的，这些该写进 PR 或发布说明。"

#: ../developer/contributing.md:278
msgid ""
"**Leave out the details of any one installation** — its hosts, model ids,"
" accounts and measurements. They belong in that distribution's own "
"documentation."
msgstr "**不要写某个具体部署的细节**——它的主机、模型 id、账号和测量数据。这些属于那个发行版自己的文档。"

#: ../developer/contributing.md:281
msgid ""
"**Use the words in the [Glossary](glossary.md)**, and add a term there "
"before relying on a new one."
msgstr "**用[术语表](glossary.md)里的词**；要用一个新术语，先把它加进术语表。"

#: ../developer/contributing.md:283
msgid ""
"**Keep a paragraph to one idea.** When it piles up conditions, make it a "
"list or a table."
msgstr "**一个段落只讲一件事**。条件一多，就改成列表或表格。"

#: ../developer/contributing.md:285
msgid ""
"**When a setting does not do what its name suggests, say so in one "
"sentence**, add it to [Settings that currently have no "
"effect](configuration.md#settings-that-currently-have-no-effect), and "
"open an issue, rather than explaining the internals at length."
msgstr ""
"**如果某个设置的实际作用和它的名字对不上，用一句话说明**，把它加进[目前不生效的设置](configuration.md#settings-"
"that-currently-have-no-effect)，并提一个 issue，而不是长篇解释内部实现。"

#: ../developer/contributing.md:290
msgid "Translations"
msgstr "翻译"

#: ../developer/contributing.md:292
msgid ""
"The site is published in English and Chinese, and an English edit changes"
" the paragraph a translation is attached to. Update the Chinese in the "
"same pull request; [Translating the Docs](translations.md) explains how."
msgstr ""
"站点同时发布英文版和中文版。译文是挂在英文段落上的，改动英文段落，挂在上面的译文就对不上了。请在同一个 PR "
"里更新中文，具体做法见[翻译文档](translations.md)。"

#: ../developer/contributing.md:296
msgid "Proposing a change"
msgstr "提出改动"

#: ../developer/contributing.md:298
msgid ""
"**Branch off `dev`, not `main`.** Pull requests target `dev`; CI runs on "
"pull requests against `main` and `dev`."
msgstr "**从 `dev` 开分支，而不是 `main`**。PR 提向 `dev`；针对 `main` 和 `dev` 的 PR 都会跑 CI。"

#: ../developer/contributing.md:300
msgid ""
"**Name branches `<user>/<scope>/<feature-name>`**, e.g. `jane/routing"
"/weighted-fallback`."
msgstr ""
"**分支命名为 `<user>/<scope>/<feature-name>`**，例如 `jane/routing/weighted-"
"fallback`。"

#: ../developer/contributing.md:302
msgid ""
"**Write commit and pull-request titles as conventional commits** — "
"`type(scope): summary`, e.g. `fix(routing): keep the fallback route on "
"429`. History on `dev` is squashed one commit per pull request, so the "
"title you write becomes the commit subject — `git log --oneline` shows "
"the shape to match."
msgstr ""
"**commit 和 PR 的标题写成 conventional commits 的形式**——`type(scope): summary`，例如"
" `fix(routing): keep the fallback route on 429`。`dev` 上的历史按每个 PR 压成一个 "
"commit，所以你写的 PR 标题就是最终的 commit 标题，格式参照 `git log --oneline` 即可。"

#: ../developer/contributing.md:307
msgid ""
"Keep a pull request to one feature or fix, update the docs in the same "
"change, and add tests for new behaviour."
msgstr "一个 PR 只做一个功能或一处修复，文档在同一个 PR 里一起更新，并为新行为补上测试。"

#: ../developer/contributing.md:309
msgid ""
"Call out changes to API behavior, configuration, defaults or database "
"schema in the PR, with migration steps and rollback limits. See [Releases"
" and upgrades](releases.md#compatibility-and-breaking-changes)."
msgstr ""
"在 PR 中明确说明 API 行为、配置、默认值或数据库 schema "
"的变化，并提供迁移步骤和回滚限制。参见[发布与升级](releases.md#compatibility-and-breaking-"
"changes)。"

#: ../developer/contributing.md:312
msgid "Do not commit to `main` or `dev` directly."
msgstr "不要直接向 `main` 或 `dev` 提交。"

#: ../developer/contributing.md:314
msgid "What CI will run"
msgstr "CI 会跑什么"

#: ../developer/contributing.md:316
msgid ""
"The `CI` workflow (`.github/workflows/ci.yml`) classifies which paths a "
"pull request touched and then runs only the relevant jobs:"
msgstr "`CI` 这个 workflow（`.github/workflows/ci.yml`）会先判断 PR 改动了哪些路径，再只运行相关的 job："

#: ../developer/contributing.md
msgid "Job"
msgstr "作业"

#: ../developer/contributing.md
msgid "What it does"
msgstr "作用"

#: ../developer/contributing.md
msgid "Backend Quality"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/contributing.md
msgid "`ruff format --check`, `ruff check --no-fix`, `pydocstyle`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/contributing.md
msgid "Frontend Quality"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/contributing.md
msgid "prettier, eslint, `tsc --noEmit`, vitest, `npm audit`"
msgstr ""

