msgid ""
"builds the frontend image with no module and with the example's Site UI "
"module, requires a module build that lacks its context to fail, and "
"checks how the running example serves its assets"
msgstr "分别构建不带模块和带示例 Site UI 模块的前端镜像，确认缺少上下文的模块构建会失败，并检查运行中的示例如何提供它的静态资源"

#: ../developer/contributing.md
msgid "Docs Build"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/contributing.md
msgid ""
"`make docs-verify`: both languages built with warnings as errors, local "
"links checked, and every translation checked against the English"
msgstr "`make docs-verify`：构建两种语言并把警告当作错误，检查本地链接，并把每条译文都和英文对照检查"

#: ../developer/contributing.md
msgid "`test`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/contributing.md
msgid ""
"pytest across four shards with a PostgreSQL service, `-m \"not "
"external\"` — so the `dbtest` tier does run in CI even though it is "
"excluded from `make test`"
msgstr ""
"分四个分片跑 pytest，带 PostgreSQL 服务，参数为 `-m \"not external\"`——所以 `dbtest` "
"这一层虽然不在 `make test` 里，CI 却会跑"

#: ../developer/contributing.md
msgid "Security Scan"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/contributing.md
msgid ""
"`gitleaks detect` over the tree, then `pip-audit` against the exported "
"production requirements"
msgstr "对整棵代码树跑 `gitleaks detect`，再对导出的生产依赖清单跑 `pip-audit`"

#: ../developer/contributing.md
msgid "`docker-build`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/contributing.md
msgid "builds the affected images, then starts the runnable example and smokes it"
msgstr "构建受影响的镜像，再启动可运行的示例并做冒烟测试"

#: ../developer/contributing.md
msgid "Tutorial E2E"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/contributing.md
msgid ""
"runs the Quickstart's `make up` → `make smoke` → `make demo` → `make "
"demo-smoke` sequence"
msgstr "运行快速开始里的 `make up` → `make smoke` → `make demo` → `make demo-smoke` 这一整串命令"

#: ../developer/contributing.md
msgid "CI Gate"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/contributing.md
msgid "aggregates the results of the jobs above into one check"
msgstr "把上面各个 job 的结果汇总成一个检查项"

#: ../developer/contributing.md:331
msgid ""
"Because CI includes `dbtest`, a change to storage or auth can be green "
"locally and red in CI. Run `make test-db` against a local Postgres when "
"you touch `apps/backend/serving/storage/` or the auth surface."
msgstr ""
"因为 CI 包含 `dbtest`，改动存储或认证时，可能本地全绿而 CI 报红。改动 "
"`apps/backend/serving/storage/` 或认证相关接口时，要对着本地 Postgres 跑一遍 `make test-"
"db`。"

#: ../developer/contributing.md:335
msgid ""
"If a pull request shows no CI run at all, check whether it has a merge "
"conflict first — a conflicted pull request does not trigger the "
"`pull_request` workflow."
msgstr "如果一个 PR 一次 CI 运行都没有，先看它是不是有合并冲突——有冲突的 PR 不会触发 `pull_request` workflow。"
